00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:48.834
Exactly.

00:17:48.834 --> 00:17:49.101
Yeah.

00:17:49.101 --> 00:17:54.807
passed down through times,
you know, also the houses in my grandparents community

00:17:54.807 --> 00:17:57.576
were built like that

00:17:57.576 --> 00:18:00.579
by people,

00:18:00.646 --> 00:18:03.782
Now for everything you need to sign papers

00:18:03.816 --> 00:18:04.750
Yeah. You know

00:18:05.717 --> 00:18:08.921
sometimes... like, in a rural area,

00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:12.091
It's fine doing things on your own

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:13.792
in cities, no

00:18:13.792 --> 00:18:16.795
It's impossible, no chance.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.833
No. But like, I get what you mean.

00:18:21.433 --> 00:18:23.102
Because if you have,

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:28.340
like, a specific building style
in a specific area and everybody has seen

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:32.077
that specific style be built already,
like you've been there as a kid.

00:18:32.644 --> 00:18:35.013
Yeah, exactly.

00:18:35.013 --> 00:18:39.351
So then you just show up and, you know,
like, oh, but nobody's doing the reef

00:18:39.751 --> 00:18:41.720
Okay, I'll do the reef

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:42.354
Exactly.

00:18:42.354 --> 00:18:45.357
Yeah. It's it's how it works.

00:18:46.058 --> 00:18:51.063
And it's beautiful
because I think heritage is exactly about this is about

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:55.767
building culture and techniques over time.

00:18:55.767 --> 00:19:00.172
But it's not like a genius,
like one person invented something.

00:19:00.239 --> 00:19:05.444
It is more like a modern way of thinking.

00:19:05.444 --> 00:19:07.546
That a new idea.

00:19:07.546 --> 00:19:12.084
One single person coming in
and being a genius, in the past...

00:19:12.084 --> 00:19:15.087
we build everything together.

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:17.523
Yeah, it's much more of like,

00:19:17.523 --> 00:19:20.526
an evolutionary process.

00:19:21.026 --> 00:19:22.327
Actually, it still works like that.

00:19:22.327 --> 00:19:24.096
But we have the illusion that it's like.

00:19:24.096 --> 00:19:28.233
An architect that is coming
has a new invention or new idea, but

00:19:29.434 --> 00:19:33.572
we are just, you know, the descendants
of something else.

00:19:34.072 --> 00:19:37.075
So, yeah, this was her thesis.

00:19:37.543 --> 00:19:41.947
oh woow! amazing, beautiful

