so it will be much better.

00:37:49.467 --> 00:37:52.570
So the second one and those ones
will be also be slightly higher.

00:37:56.707 --> 00:37:57.041
Yeah.

00:37:57.041 --> 00:38:03.114
So there's going to be two steel pieces
on the sides with some different holes.

00:38:03.114 --> 00:38:04.849
So I can put them on different positions.

00:38:04.849 --> 00:38:08.119
So depending on like in March or October

00:38:08.819 --> 00:38:11.589
I want to have the more on a bit steeper
but not too steep

00:38:11.589 --> 00:38:14.892
