during this period.

00:38:24.368 --> 00:38:28.773
And just as the season progresses
I can put them up steeper or less steep

00:38:30.308 --> 00:38:32.510
So yeah, but quite a bit of work
still to do.

00:38:32.510 --> 00:38:39.750
Also digging on all the cables
so I can keep it clean with the trimmer,

00:38:39.750 --> 00:38:41.852
you know.

00:38:41.852 --> 00:38:46.090
Mostly it has to be built higher and stronger.

00:38:46.424 --> 00:38:48.659
The floor is going well

00:38:48.659 --> 00:38:51.796
there were some air pockets
after the first pour.

00:38:51.829 --> 00:38:54.899
It looked very good because all the water
is just sitting on top.

00:38:56.100 --> 00:38:59.070
But once it started to dry 

00:38:59.070 --> 00:39:02.206
you could quickly see a few air pockets here and there.

00:39:02.840 --> 00:39:05.643
So I had to do a second run.

00:39:05.643 --> 00:39:08.612
Now I have to wait a bit longer
for it to cure,

00:39:08.646 --> 00:39:11.882
and then I can, I can grind it down
and polish it

00:39:11.882 --> 00:39:14.952
