but I’m really happy with it.

00:39:14.952 --> 00:39:17.321
It looks really... the color looks good.

00:39:17.321 --> 00:39:19.256
It's a beautiful flat floor.

00:39:20.725 --> 00:39:21.759
So that's going to look great.

